OL,3,GNEWSAFaults hit new #10m swing bridge
OL,4,A'more frequently than 1938 crossing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Highland councillor says a #10m swing
OL,7,Fbridge on the Caledonian Canal in
OL,8,FInverness appears to be affected by
OL,9,Ffaults more often than an 88-year-old
OL,10,Fcrossing next to it.
OL,12,FThe Torvean Swing Bridge, which was
OL,13,Fopened in 2021, has been closed to road
OL,14,Ftraffic for two weeks.
OL,16,FEarlier this summer, it was closed for
OL,17,Fabout five weeks following an oil leak.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
