OL,3,GNEWSAFaults hit new #10m swing bridge
OL,4,A'more frequently than 1938 crossing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Alex Graham said: "There are
OL,7,Fproblems intermittently with it much
OL,8,Fmore frequently than the adjoining
OL,9,FTomnahurich Bridge which was installed
OL,10,Fin 1938."
